  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>Field gun platoons crew heavy-caliber autocannons capable of punching through vehicle armor and damaging BattleMech components with concentrated fire. The heavier autocannon variants deliver devastating single shots at the cost of increased weight and ammunition demands that limit the crew to deliberate firing positions. Emplacement and displacement take time, making these platoons most effective in prepared defensive positions where their firepower can be brought to bear along predicted avenues of approach.</p>"
